      ⍝ Bugs41 #59: an out-of-range ⎕MX subfunction number is a DOMAIN ERROR (checked
      ⍝ before it is used as a subfunction)




      ⎕MX[¯1] 5
DOMAIN ERROR+
      ⎕MX[¯1]5
      ^

      ⎕MX[1000 0] 5
DOMAIN ERROR+
      ⎕MX[1000 0]5
      ^

      2 ⎕MX[¯1] 5
DOMAIN ERROR+
      2 ⎕MX[¯1]5
      ^ ^

      ⎕MX[¯2147483648] 5
DOMAIN ERROR+
      ⎕MX[¯2147483648]5
      ^

      )SIC





